    "Hide the menu bar icon while Reopen continues running in the background. Launch Reopen again anytime to open Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Helper text under the Show Menu Bar Icon toggle, explaining how to reopen Settings once the icon is hidden.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blende das Menüleisten-Symbol aus, während Reopen im Hintergrund weiterläuft. Starte Reopen jederzeit erneut, um die Einstellungen zu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Masquez l’icône dans la barre des menus pendant que Reopen continue de fonctionner en arrière-plan. Relancez Reopen à tout moment pour ouvrir les réglages."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reopenがバックグラウンドで動作を続ける間、メニューバーのアイコンを非表示にします。Reopenをもう一度起動すると、いつでも設定を開けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏菜单栏图标，Reopen 继续在后台运行。随时再次启动 Reopen 即可打开设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it’s made Cmd+Tab feel better, a quick App Store review helps more people find it." : {
      "comment" : "Body copy for Command Reopen’s one-time custom review prompt.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
